---
import Layout from "../layouts/Plain.astro";
---
<Layout title="Terms — darsay">
	<main class="plain">
		<h1>Terms</h1>
		<p>
			This site is documentation plus a coordination ledger. It does not host model weights.
			Fetching and archiving happens with the darsay CLI from upstream (Hugging Face and others)
			or by sneakernet of a vault.
		</p>
		<p>
			A board row is a citation of a public source ref, the same as a line in
			<code>catalog.json</code>. “Have” is an unverified claim that someone has a bundle on
			disk.
		</p>
		<p>The URL is access. Do not put secrets other than the URL itself into the holders field.</p>
		<p>The software is Apache 2.0. See the GitHub repositories under darsay-io.</p>
	</main>
</Layout>
